{"version":1,"content":"<p><strong>10月23日，NASA局長賈裏德·艾薩克曼在甘迺迪航天中心發佈會上公佈阿耳忒彌斯加速計劃，明確爭取兩年內讓太空人重返月球表面。按照最新安排，阿耳忒彌斯4號任務仍定於2028年實施，屆時將實現自阿波羅計劃以來首次載人登月，</strong>並在月球南極附近着陸，為建立月面長期存在與月球基地、進而邁向火星任務打基礎。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1583664.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T06:31:38.839773+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":154,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T06:17:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T06:27:48.697017+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T06:27:48.697017+00:00","content_hash":"653b51af78de5f7f85e5ac7b4d513712e42ea2b6f75381954ae4f8bcf766150f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}